al network connecting computers","translation":"internet","example":"The internet gives users quick access to information.","synonyms":["web"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"smartphone","meaning":"a mobile phone with internet and apps","translation":"điện thoại thông minh","example":"Many teenagers use a smartphone every day.","synonyms":["mobile phone"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"device","meaning":"a piece of equipment made for a particular purpose","translation":"thiết bị","example":"Digital devices can support online learning.","synonyms":["gadget"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"website","meaning":"a set of pages available on the internet","translation":"trang web","example":"The government website provides public information.","synonyms":["web page"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"online","meaning":"connected to or available through the internet","translation":"trực tuyến","example":"Many people now shop and study online.","synonyms":["on the internet"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"digital","meaning":"using electronic technology or computer systems","translation":"kỹ thuật số","example":"Digital payments are becoming more common.","synonyms":["electronic"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"information","meaning":"facts or details about something","translation":"thông tin","example":"People should check information before sharing it online.","synonyms":["data"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"screen","meaning":"the flat surface that displays images on a device","translation":"màn hình","example":"Too much screen time may affect children's sleep.","synonyms":["display"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"software","meaning":"programs used by a computer","translation":"phần mềm","example":"Schools may need new software for online classes.","synonyms":["programs"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"machine","meaning":"equipment that uses power to do work","translation":"máy móc","example":"Modern machines can complete repetitive tasks quickly.","synonyms":["equipment"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"connect","meaning":"to join or communicate through a network","translation":"kết nối","example":"The app allows users to connect with friends abroad.","synonyms":["link"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Technology Basics","word":"convenient","meaning":"easy and useful for a person's needs","translation":"tiện lợi","example":"Online banking is convenient for many customers.","synonyms":["handy"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"environment","meaning":"the natural world around people, animals and plants","translation":"môi trường","example":"Everyone can take simple steps to protect the environment.","synonyms":["natural world"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"litter","meaning":"waste left in public places instead of being disposed of properly","translation":"rác xả bừa bãi","example":"More public bins can reduce litter in parks and streets.","synonyms":["rubbish"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Environment Basics","word":"waste","meaning":"unwanted material that is thrown away","translation":"rác thải","