:"lái xe","example":"People should not drive when they are extremely tired.","synonyms":["operate a vehicle"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"accident","meaning":"an unexpected event that causes injury or damage","translation":"tai nạn","example":"Speeding increases the chance of a road accident.","synonyms":["crash"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"congestion","meaning":"a situation in which roads are too full of traffic","translation":"tắc nghẽn giao thông","example":"Better bus services may help reduce congestion.","synonyms":["traffic jam"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Transport","word":"vehicle","meaning":"a machine used to transport people or goods","translation":"phương tiện","example":"Electric vehicles are becoming more common in cities.","synonyms":["means of transport"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"food","meaning":"things that people eat","translation":"thức ăn","example":"Healthy food should be affordable for all families.","synonyms":["nutrition"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"meal","meaning":"food eaten at a particular time","translation":"bữa ăn","example":"Eating regular meals can support a balanced lifestyle.","synonyms":["dish"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"fruit","meaning":"the sweet part of a plant that people eat","translation":"trái cây","example":"Fresh fruit is a good source of vitamins.","synonyms":["produce"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Food & Diet","word":"vegetable","meaning":"an edible plant or part of a plant","translation":"rau củ","example":"Children should be encouraged to eat more vegetables.","synonyms":["greens"]},