ing":"likely to cause harm","translation":"nguy hiểm","example":"Using a phone while driving is dangerous.","synonyms":["unsafe"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Crime & Safety","word":"steal","meaning":"to take something that belongs to another person","translation":"ăn cắp","example":"People may steal when they face serious financial problems.","synonyms":["take illegally"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Crime & Safety","word":"theft","meaning":"the crime of stealing","translation":"trộm cắp","example":"Security cameras may help reduce theft.","synonyms":["stealing"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Crime & Safety","word":"prison","meaning":"a place where criminals are kept as punishment","translation":"nhà tù","example":"Prison sentences are used for serious offences.","synonyms":["jail"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Crime & Safety","word":"punish","meaning":"to make someone suffer a penalty for wrongdoing","translation":"trừng phạt","example":"Society must decide how to punish serious offenders.","synonyms":["penalise"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Crime & Safety","word":"victim","meaning":"a person harmed by a crime or accident","translation":"nạn nhân","example":"Victims of violence may need long-term support.","synonyms":["person harmed"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Crime & Safety","word":"violence","meaning":"behaviour intended to hurt people","translation":"bạo lực","example":"Communities need effective ways to prevent violence.","synonyms":["aggression"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Crime & Safety","word":"rule","meaning":"an instruction about what is allowed","translation":"quy tắc","example":"Clear rules can improve safety in public places.","synonyms":["regulation"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Crime & Safety","word":"security","meaning":"protection against danger or crime","translation":"an ninh","example":"Airport security has become stricter in many countries.","synonyms":["protection"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Government & Public Services","word":"government","meaning":"the group of people who control a country","translation":"chính phủ","example":"The government can invest in schools and hospitals.","synonyms":["state"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Government & Public Services","word":"public service","meaning":"a service provided for the public, often by government","translation":"dịch vụ công","example":"Reliable public services improve quality of life.","synonyms":["government service"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Government & Public Services","word":"tax","meaning":"money paid to government to fund services","translation":"thuế","example":"Taxes can be used to improve public transport.","synonyms":["levy"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Government & Public Services","word":"citizen","meaning":"a legal member of a country","translation":"công dân","example":"Citizens should understand their rights and duties.","synonyms":["member of society"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Government & Public Services","word":"policy","meaning":"an official plan or set of ideas","translation":"chính sách","example":"A clear policy can guide long-term development.","synonyms":["strategy"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Government & Public Services","word":"authority","meaning":"an organisation with official power","translation":"cơ quan có thẩm quyền","example":"Local authorities manage 