d occasion or activity","translation":"sự kiện","example":"A local event can bring neighbours together.","synonyms":["occasion"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"park","meaning":"a public green area for recreation","translation":"công viên","example":"Families use the park for exercise and relaxation.","synonyms":["green space"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"library","meaning":"a place where people can borrow books and use information","translation":"thư viện","example":"Public libraries provide quiet study spaces.","synonyms":["public library"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"market","meaning":"a place where people buy and sell goods","translation":"chợ","example":"Local markets can support small producers.","synonyms":["marketplace"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"friendship","meaning":"a relationship between friends","translation":"tình bạn","example":"Community activities can create new friendships.","synonyms":["companionship"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"social activity","meaning":"an activity done with other people","translation":"hoạt động xã hội","example":"Social activities can reduce loneliness among older adults.","synonyms":["group activity"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Community & Neighbours","word":"belong","meaning":"to feel accepted as part of a group","translation":"thuộc về","example":"People are happier when they feel they belong to a community.","synonyms":["fit in"]},{"groupKey":"g1","groupName":"Nhóm 1 - Nền tảng Band 3.5-5.0","topicName":"Culture & Festivals","word":"culture","meaning":"the ideas, customs and way of 